    "section_construction_options_EK6GLr": {
      "type": "section-construction-options",
      "blocks": {
        "option_ak8XMx": {
          "type": "option",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Rod Pocket",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Curtain-Construction-Rod-Pocket.png",
            "content": "<p>This classic curtain style offers a clean look with a sewn-in pocket to accommodate hardware. Rod pocket curtains are primarily decorative—not for everyday use.</p><p><strong>DETAILS</strong><br/>We suggest a 1.25\" or smaller rod to accommodate sewn pocket. Rod is not included. </p>",
            "button_text": "SEE OUR HARDWARE EDIT",
            "button_link": "shopify://blogs/the-thread/curtain-hardware"
          }
        },
        "option_njc7D3": {
          "type": "option",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ring Top",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Curtain-Construction-Ring-Top.png",
            "content": "<p>These panels are hung by attaching their built-in hooks to your curtain rings. Easy to use, these are great for spaces where you plan on opening and closing your drapes every day.</p><p><strong>DETAILS</strong><br/>Curtain hooks are sewn in. Rod and rings are not included. </p><p><a href=\"/blogs/pep-talk/curtain-hardware\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Hardware\"><strong>SEE OUR HARDWARE EDIT</strong></a></p><ul><li>25” - 6 Hooks</li><li>50” - 12 Hooks</li><li>75” - 17 Hooks</li><li>100” - 21 Hooks</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "SEE OUR HARDWARE EDIT",
            "button_link": "shopify://blogs/the-thread/curtain-hardware"
          }
        },
        "option_TGQAjt": {
          "type": "option",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Grommets",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Curtain-Construction-Grommet.png",
            "content": "<p>This modern option offers a streamlined take on ringed styles, with embedded black metal grommets that are sturdy enough for daily use. </p><p><strong>DETAILS<br/></strong>Curtain grommets have an inside diameter of 1.56\" and are sewn in. We suggest using a black rod to match the grommets. Rod is not included. </p><p><a href=\"/blogs/pep-talk/curtain-hardware\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Hardware\"><strong>SEE OUR HARDWARE EDIT</strong></a></p><ul><li>25” - 4 Grommets</li><li>50” - 8 Grommets</li><li>75” - 10 Grommets</li><li>100” - 14 Grommets </li></ul>",
            "button_text": "SEE OUR HARDWARE EDIT",
            "button_link": "shopify://blogs/the-thread/curtain-hardware"
          }
        },
        "option_yRjiYM": {
          "type": "option",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Pinch Pleat",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Curtain-Construction-Pinch-Pleat.png",
            "content": "<p>Made with twice as much fabric, these panels offer a voluminous look. Triple pleats add an elegant, formal flair while their hooks make it easy to attach to rings.</p><p><strong>DETAILS</strong> <br/>Curtain hooks are sewn in. Rod and rings are not included. Pleated curtain width refers to the finished top width.</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/pep-talk/curtain-hardware\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Hardware\"><strong>SEE OUR HARDWARE EDIT</strong></a></p><ul><li>25\" - 6 Hooks</li><li>50\" - 12 Hooks</li><li>75\" - 18 Hooks</li><li>100\" - 22 Hooks</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "SEE OUR HARDWARE EDIT",
            "button_link": "shopify://blogs/the-thread/curtain-hardware"
          }
        },
        "option_MW8xmK": {
          "type": "option",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Tailored Pleat",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Curtain-Construction-Tailored-Pleat.png",
            "content": "<p>A more modern silhouette than pinch pleat, tailored pleats bring a subtle sophistication to any room. Made with twice as much fabric, these panels offer a voluminous look.</p><p><strong>DETAILS</strong> <br/>Curtain hooks are sewn in. Rod and rings are not included. Pleated curtain width refers to the finished top width.</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/pep-talk/curtain-hardware\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Curtain Hardware\"><strong>SEE OUR HARDWARE EDIT</strong></a></p><ul><li>25\" - 7 Hooks</li><li>50\" - 12 Hooks</li><li>75\" - 18 Hooks</li><li>100\" - 22 Hooks</li></ul>",
            "button_text": "SEE OUR HARDWARE EDIT",
            "button_link": "shopify://blogs/the-thread/curtain-hardware"
          }
        }
      },
